WEBVTT

00:13.180 --> 00:14.460
<b>Sorry for the wait.</b>

00:14.460 --> 00:17.030
<b>We couldn't wait any longer, Hiroto-kun!</b>

00:17.030 --> 00:18.400
<b>Glad you're back, Shino!</b>

00:18.770 --> 00:21.200
<b>Welcome back, Master.</b>

00:21.810 --> 00:24.240
<b>Guess this means everything's back in order.</b>

00:24.550 --> 00:26.710
<b>You're such a slowpoke, Hiroto-kun.</b>

00:26.710 --> 00:28.220
<b>Like usual.</b>

00:32.900 --> 00:35.210
<b>Why, you sneaky little...</b>

00:35.730 --> 00:39.700
<b>Never mind. I'll use my pieces on the board...</b>

00:41.230 --> 00:43.730
<b>to crush you as many times as it takes.</b>

00:49.690 --> 00:52.530
<b>Let's review the 
situation one more time.</b>

00:50.480 --> 00:55.400
<b>Soldiers 
and Friends</b>

00:53.210 --> 00:55.990
<b>Just before the first period
of the fourth day ended,</b>

00:55.990 --> 00:58.530
<b>I got all the teams not under 
Miss Hundred Faces' control...</b>

00:58.530 --> 00:59.530
<b>District 2</b>

00:58.530 --> 00:59.530
<b>Suisei Academy</b>

00:58.880 --> 00:59.890
<b>Suisei,</b>

00:59.530 --> 01:00.530
<b>District 3</b>

00:59.530 --> 01:00.530
<b>Ouka Academy</b>

00:59.890 --> 01:00.760
<b>Ouka,</b>

01:00.530 --> 01:01.540
<b>District 10</b>

01:00.530 --> 01:01.540
<b>Oumi Academy</b>

01:00.760 --> 01:01.690
<b>Oumi,</b>

01:01.540 --> 01:02.540
<b>District 13</b>

01:01.540 --> 01:02.540
<b>Murakamo Academy</b>

01:01.690 --> 01:02.800
<b>Murakumo,</b>

01:02.540 --> 01:04.540
<b>District 19</b>

01:02.540 --> 01:04.540
<b>Souken Academy</b>

01:02.800 --> 01:04.540
<b>and Souken to form an alliance with us.</b>

01:04.940 --> 01:09.720
<b>Including Eimei, there are 20 players 
still active in our Allied Army.</b>

01:09.720 --> 01:13.040
<b>Miss Hundred Faces' United Army
 has a total of 14 players.</b>

01:13.050 --> 01:20.430
<b>Seijo Academy</b>

01:13.050 --> 01:20.430
<b>Shinra</b>

01:13.050 --> 01:20.430
<b>Otowa</b>

01:13.050 --> 01:20.430
<b>Tsuyuri</b>

01:13.050 --> 01:20.430
<b>Saint Rosalia</b>

01:13.570 --> 01:20.420
<b>In terms of academies, that means Seijo, 
Shinra, Otowa, Saint Rosalia, and Tsuyuri.</b>

01:20.890 --> 01:23.180
<b>So we have more people.</b>

01:23.180 --> 01:26.550
<b>But they have a lot more
 in the way of firepower.</b>

01:26.550 --> 01:30.570
<b>Even united, the strongest teams don't stand
 a chance against Kugasaki and Kururugi.</b>

01:30.980 --> 01:34.310
<b>Miss Hundred Faces is 
an unauthorized player,</b>

01:34.310 --> 01:36.830
<b>propped up by the former 
Seijo headmaster, Kurahashi.</b>

01:37.270 --> 01:41.070
<b>She's been using illegal methods 
to change any setting she wants.</b>

01:41.380 --> 01:44.220
<b>Movement Value set to max.
 Unlimited spells.</b>

01:44.220 --> 01:49.290
<b>She combined the benefits of the various roles,
 and had full map access from the start.</b>

01:49.290 --> 01:53.090
<b>And the cherry on top is
she has 999 life points.</b>

01:53.370 --> 01:55.350
<b>Wait, 999?!</b>

01:55.350 --> 01:56.800
<b>She's, like, invincible.</b>

01:57.070 --> 02:00.510
<b>No, there's still one way to beat her.</b>

02:01.260 --> 02:02.850
<b>The Demon Maiden.</b>

02:04.800 --> 02:10.330
<b>Even with 999 life points, Kururugi Senri's 
One-Shot Kill might be able to take her down.</b>

02:11.060 --> 02:14.850
<b>So that's the only way to 
beat Miss Hundred Faces?</b>

02:15.290 --> 02:18.210
<b>If we can defeat Kururugi 
and make her listen,</b>

02:18.210 --> 02:20.610
<b>we might be able to 
convince her to help us.</b>

02:20.610 --> 02:24.920
<b>But if we wish to fight Kururugi-sama, 
we shall need some sort of plan.</b>

02:25.290 --> 02:27.640
<b>Yeah. We'll supplement our captured area.</b>

02:28.760 --> 02:32.870
<b>If we cut straight through here, 
we'll reach the area of our ally, Oumi.</b>

02:34.010 --> 02:36.470
<b>If we can just get them 
to give us one base...</b>

02:37.090 --> 02:40.280
<b>Oh, right! Then we can overwrite 
all of this as Eimei's area.</b>

02:40.280 --> 02:43.630
<b>If we can claim this as ours, 
it'll give us an advantage.</b>

02:44.850 --> 02:47.350
<b>I'll act as a decoy to draw the enemy away.</b>

02:47.350 --> 02:50.160
<b>Enomoto and Akizuki, you two
go meet up with Oumi Academy,</b>

02:50.160 --> 02:52.510
<b>and negotiate for one of their bases.</b>

02:53.280 --> 02:55.020
<b>I'll do my bestest!</b>

02:55.800 --> 02:58.440
<b>Can't you at least ask 
politely, Shinohara?</b>

02:58.440 --> 03:00.520
<b>Oh, quit grumbling and get to work.</b>

03:00.830 --> 03:02.530
<b>It is crucial we work together.</b>

03:02.530 --> 03:05.160
<b>All right. You know what to do, guys.</b>

03:05.160 --> 03:07.040
<b>We can't hold back at all.</b>

03:07.790 --> 03:09.340
<b>This is all-out war.</b>

03:09.660 --> 03:13.460
<b>S-S-Something wild is 
about to happen, meow!</b>

03:13.460 --> 03:20.670
<b>Allied Army</b>

03:13.460 --> 03:20.670
<b>United Army</b>

03:13.460 --> 03:20.670
<b>United Army</b>

03:13.460 --> 03:20.670
<b>Attack</b>

03:13.850 --> 03:17.080
<b>The Allied Army Eimei has put together</b>

03:17.080 --> 03:20.660
<b>is taking the fight to Miss Hundred 
Faces' United Army, meow!</b>

03:20.660 --> 03:23.430
<b>The United Army holds 
the center of the map,</b>

03:20.670 --> 03:21.130
<b>Allied Army</b>

03:20.670 --> 03:21.130
<b>United Army</b>

03:20.670 --> 03:21.130
<b><i>Attack</i></b>

03:23.430 --> 03:27.340
<b>and the Allied Army plans to squeeze
 them from above and below, meow!</b>

03:27.340 --> 03:29.240
<b>The first engagement is on the right.</b>

03:28.970 --> 03:34.690
<b>Allied Army</b>

03:28.970 --> 03:34.690
<b>United Army</b>

03:29.240 --> 03:31.950
<b>The main unit of Miss 
Hundred Faces' United Army</b>

03:31.950 --> 03:35.080
<b>clashes with the Empress, 
Saionji Sarasa, of the Allied Army!</b>

03:35.080 --> 03:40.610
<b>In the center, Kirigaya Touya and 
Kugasaki Seiran's Absolute Monarchy team</b>

03:35.360 --> 03:44.740
<b>Allied Army</b>

03:35.360 --> 03:44.740
<b>United Army</b>

03:40.610 --> 03:44.810
<b>will battle the Allied Army's combined
Suisei Academy and Souken Academy team.</b>

03:45.480 --> 03:51.000
<b>And then next, we have Kururugi 
Senri's Demon Maiden team,</b>

03:45.490 --> 03:55.670
<b>Allied Army</b>

03:45.490 --> 03:55.670
<b>United Army</b>

03:51.000 --> 03:55.420
<b>facing off against the Allied Army's combined
Eimei Academy and Oumi Academy team!</b>

03:55.660 --> 03:59.680
<b>There's only one person who can 
fight his way through this mess, meow.</b>

03:59.670 --> 04:03.010
<b>Eimei Academy's Shinohara Hiroto</b>

03:59.680 --> 04:03.570
<b>Back from the brink of death, 
Mr. "Strongest" himself: the Seven Star!</b>

04:03.570 --> 04:09.330
<b>Shinohara Hiroto's preparing to unleash 
Armageddon all over the map, meow!</b>

04:08.010 --> 04:10.020
<b>Support Rating</b>

04:10.310 --> 04:13.210
<b><i>Shinohara-kun, the rest is up to you, meow.</i></b>

04:15.660 --> 04:16.690
<b>So you came.</b>

04:19.750 --> 04:21.410
<b><i>Doesn't look like she wants to fight.</i></b>

04:21.710 --> 04:23.910
<b><i>Or maybe she can't?</i></b>

04:23.910 --> 04:26.180
<b>Unfortunately for you, Seven Star,</b>

04:26.180 --> 04:29.160
<b>this is a specialist team 
that excels in interception.</b>

04:29.160 --> 04:32.690
<b>So make it easy for yourself 
and go down quietly!</b>

04:35.660 --> 04:36.290
<b>Huh?</b>

04:36.290 --> 04:37.040
<b>No way!</b>

04:41.070 --> 04:43.060
<b><i>Nice one, student council prez.</i></b>

04:43.060 --> 04:44.940
<b>Here I go!</b>

04:45.480 --> 04:46.340
<b>Incoming!</b>

04:46.340 --> 04:47.420
<b>Tch. From behind?</b>

04:54.350 --> 04:56.040
<b>The Seven Star is mine!</b>

04:59.170 --> 05:00.150
<b>Too slow.</b>

05:19.470 --> 05:20.300
<b>All right.</b>

05:24.620 --> 05:26.580
<b>Take this!</b>

05:35.640 --> 05:38.470
<b>Looks like our victory 
is pretty much assured.</b>

05:39.930 --> 05:41.760
<b>I'm releasing the restraints.</b>

05:46.130 --> 05:51.350
<b>You punks, sneaking up on us 
from behind like that. How pathetic.</b>

05:51.790 --> 05:53.130
<b>Judgment!</b>

05:57.640 --> 05:59.170
<b><i>We lost one from Oumi.</i></b>

05:59.510 --> 06:01.930
<b><i>So she was being held back.</i></b>

06:01.930 --> 06:06.930
<b>My top priority is to bury you, 
Shinohara Hiroto, with my own two hands.</b>

06:07.220 --> 06:09.940
<b>The rest of you aren't worth my time.</b>

06:09.940 --> 06:11.390
<b>Grr!</b>

06:11.390 --> 06:15.820
<b>Shinji, I'm gonna handle this my way,
 so back me up however you like.</b>

06:16.700 --> 06:18.620
<b>Unreasonable like always.</b>

06:19.130 --> 06:22.320
<b>But I can accept it. Do it your way, Nanase.</b>

06:23.580 --> 06:24.970
<b>Gotcha!</b>

06:25.450 --> 06:27.590
<b>Why don't you just disappear?</b>

06:28.900 --> 06:31.960
<b>You expect me to dodge? Not my style!</b>

06:33.450 --> 06:34.440
<b>What?</b>

06:36.380 --> 06:37.750
<b>What <i>was</i> that?</b>

06:40.710 --> 06:43.050
<b>An assist ability. Lightning Rod.</b>

06:43.040 --> 06:50.050
<b>Lightning
\h\hRod</b>

06:43.320 --> 06:45.980
<b>It made me your target instead.</b>

06:45.980 --> 06:50.040
<b>And since I was out of range, 
your attack obviously didn't connect.</b>

06:50.310 --> 06:51.160
<b>Sweet!</b>

06:51.160 --> 06:52.550
<b>That was outstanding.</b>

06:53.350 --> 06:54.140
<b>It's not over.</b>

06:54.140 --> 06:55.640
<b>Don't even think about it!</b>

06:55.640 --> 06:57.510
<b>C'mon, c'mon, c'mon, c'mon!</b>

06:59.010 --> 06:59.770
<b>Damn.</b>

07:00.090 --> 07:01.480
<b>I need to keep my distance.</b>

07:04.690 --> 07:05.440
<b>Wha...</b>

07:09.690 --> 07:12.250
<b>How did you do that from so far away?</b>

07:12.630 --> 07:14.950
<b>It's an ability, obviously.</b>

07:15.030 --> 07:15.080
<b>Cornered</b>

07:15.080 --> 07:20.710
<b>Cornered</b>

07:15.390 --> 07:20.700
<b>"Cornered" increases my attack range and 
other skills when my partner's in trouble.</b>

07:20.700 --> 07:23.320
<b>And you used that to 
protect Enomoto Shinji?</b>

07:23.870 --> 07:25.620
<b>I hadn't anticipated that.</b>

07:25.620 --> 07:28.590
<b>I didn't realize you were in 
such an intimate relationship.</b>

07:28.590 --> 07:32.090
<b>Huh? W-We aren't close at all.</b>

07:38.160 --> 07:38.850
<b>Boop.</b>

07:43.120 --> 07:48.350
<b>Kururugi, you've lost this one. 
I know you said you were stronger alone,</b>

07:48.870 --> 07:50.810
<b>but seems it was just your imagination.</b>

07:50.810 --> 07:51.880
<b>What?</b>

07:52.240 --> 07:55.730
<b>Over in MTCG, I bumped 
into one of the Tsuyuri girls.</b>

07:57.150 --> 07:58.530
<b>She was kinda mad.</b>

07:58.860 --> 07:59.920
<b>Mad?</b>

08:00.230 --> 08:05.280
<b>Yeah. Because you gave in to Miss Hundred 
Faces before the battle was even over.</b>

08:05.280 --> 08:10.360
<b>Or, well, she said they were all upset you were
 forced into it because they were so weak.</b>

08:11.090 --> 08:16.640
<b>So instead of just depending on you, they want 
to become strong enough to fight together.</b>

08:16.640 --> 08:19.950
<b>Together? I see.</b>

08:20.350 --> 08:24.390
<b>I guess I never would have become 
the Demon Maiden without them.</b>

08:25.270 --> 08:29.480
<b>All right, Seven Star, 
go ahead and finish me off.</b>

08:30.260 --> 08:33.040
<b>Sorry, but I think I'll pass on that.</b>

08:33.040 --> 08:35.820
<b>There's still something 
I want you to do for me.</b>

08:38.700 --> 08:40.830
<b>ASTRAL, Rightmost Area</b>

08:42.520 --> 08:44.910
<b><i>My teammates were wiped out instantly.</i></b>

08:44.910 --> 08:46.950
<b><i>Miss Hundred Faces is too strong.</i></b>

08:46.950 --> 08:49.710
<b><i>We have to get everyone 
together and attack all at once.</i></b>

08:50.130 --> 08:54.150
<b><i>But it's all right. I know 
he'll bring reinforcements soon.</i></b>

08:57.890 --> 09:02.190
<b>Well, shucks. That wasn't such a big deal.</b>

09:02.190 --> 09:03.850
<b>Kirigaya Touya.</b>

09:03.850 --> 09:08.690
<b>Who would've thought you could repel the
 Allied Army's flank attack all by yourself?</b>

09:08.920 --> 09:12.760
<b>Yeah, well, they're all 
just a bunch of losers.</b>

09:12.760 --> 09:15.370
<b>But we're down to just the three of us, too.</b>

09:15.370 --> 09:20.640
<b>So lame. I only came to watch, but now,
 I'm like one of the main characters.</b>

09:20.640 --> 09:22.190
<b>What a pain in the butt.</b>

09:22.540 --> 09:27.520
<b>Are you serious? You're from Rosalia.
 Minami Shizuku, wasn't it?</b>

09:27.520 --> 09:32.220
<b>You throw my name around and 
act like a tyrant. It really pisses me off.</b>

09:32.220 --> 09:33.100
<b>Hey!</b>

09:33.100 --> 09:35.590
<b>You were actually 
pretty damn good, though.</b>

09:35.590 --> 09:38.890
<b>You didn't stand out, but you 
were always one step ahead.</b>

09:39.550 --> 09:42.220
<b>With the right timing, 
I might just fall for you.</b>

09:42.220 --> 09:43.380
<b>Ew.</b>

09:44.590 --> 09:49.230
<b>ASTRAL is my big chance 
to seriously boost my rep.</b>

09:50.310 --> 09:55.230
<b>As ambitious as ever. All right, 
let's think about taking Eimei down next.</b>

09:55.430 --> 09:58.480
<b>Now you're talking. It's about time.</b>

09:59.650 --> 10:02.910
<b>Sounds like you just showed 
our guys a real fun time.</b>

10:02.910 --> 10:05.910
<b>Did we? I didn't ask them
 what they thought of it.</b>

10:07.290 --> 10:11.800
<b>Well, we've got orders to hunt you and the 
Empress down and end you for good this time.</b>

10:12.110 --> 10:13.470
<b>Master.</b>

10:13.470 --> 10:19.470
<b>Yep, no doubt about it. Kirigaya Touya's 
one of them. He's working for Kurahashi.</b>

10:19.810 --> 10:22.750
<b>Cut the chitchat! Let's get this started.</b>

10:25.830 --> 10:27.600
<b>Man, that's so annoying.</b>

10:34.250 --> 10:36.690
<b>Witness the power of the Phoenix!</b>

10:48.870 --> 10:51.620
<b><i>So those two aren't the main character here.</i></b>

10:54.510 --> 10:57.290
<b>Compound Upgrade, activate.</b>

10:57.830 --> 10:59.170
<b>Compound Upgrade?</b>

10:59.170 --> 11:01.360
<b>This one's gonna be fun.</b>

10:59.170 --> 11:03.510
<b>Compound Upgrade</b>

11:01.340 --> 11:03.550
<b>Effect</b>

11:01.340 --> 11:03.550
<b>Combines identical spells 
to increase the number 
of attacks, adding 1.</b>

11:01.360 --> 11:06.810
<b>It was originally a general-purpose ability, 
but I used the Black Star to upgrade it.</b>

11:03.510 --> 11:03.550
<b>Compound Upgrade</b>

11:03.550 --> 11:03.600
<b>Compound Upgrade</b>

11:03.600 --> 11:03.760
<b>Compound Upgrade</b>

11:03.760 --> 11:03.800
<b>Compound Upgrade</b>

11:03.800 --> 11:03.850
<b>Compound Upgrade</b>

11:03.850 --> 11:03.890
<b>Compound Upgrade</b>

11:03.890 --> 11:03.970
<b>Compound Upgrade</b>

11:03.970 --> 11:04.140
<b>Compound Upgrade</b>

11:03.970 --> 11:04.140
<b>Compound Upgrade</b>

11:04.140 --> 11:05.680
<b>Compound Upgrade</b>

11:07.160 --> 11:12.860
<b>You can layer as many attack spells that 
are meant to be used separately as you want.</b>

11:12.860 --> 11:15.680
<b>All right, let's test it out.</b>

11:16.090 --> 11:17.770
<b>With Magic Blast and Swordflash.</b>

11:17.770 --> 11:18.450
<b>Huh?</b>

11:18.450 --> 11:22.670
<b>Mixed together, they make a new kind 
of combined spell. And I call it...</b>

11:23.940 --> 11:25.660
<b>Magic Blade!</b>

11:30.460 --> 11:31.620
<b>Master!</b>

11:34.120 --> 11:35.170
<b>Himeji!</b>

11:35.460 --> 11:38.250
<b><i>A combined spell? What the hell?
 That's so awesome—</i></b>

11:38.250 --> 11:39.920
<b><i>No, wait, I mean awful.</i></b>

11:41.030 --> 11:44.430
<b><i>Damn. If we only had more time,
 we could come up with a plan.</i></b>

11:47.530 --> 11:48.400
<b>Enomoto?</b>

11:48.400 --> 11:49.300
<b>Shinohara.</b>

11:49.750 --> 11:52.440
<b>We need to buy time to 
get through this, right?</b>

11:52.440 --> 11:54.550
<b>Y-Yeah, I guess.</b>

11:54.550 --> 11:55.690
<b>Huh?</b>

11:56.480 --> 11:57.560
<b>Understood.</b>

11:58.320 --> 12:02.690
<b>In that case, I'll buy some time for you.
 Use it and work your magic.</b>

12:02.690 --> 12:05.560
<b>You're Eimei's student
 council president, right?</b>

12:05.850 --> 12:08.580
<b>Okay. Take care of it, Senpai.</b>

12:08.920 --> 12:12.270
<b>I think you forgot to say 
"please," commander.</b>

12:31.250 --> 12:33.530
<b><i>I need to think up a strategy now.</i></b>

12:34.590 --> 12:37.100
<b>Oh! Himeji, do your thing.</b>

12:37.980 --> 12:40.700
<b>Um... R-Right!</b>

12:41.280 --> 12:43.110
<b>Replacement</b>

12:43.640 --> 12:45.340
<b>The final blow.</b>

12:46.960 --> 12:47.940
<b>What the...</b>

12:49.140 --> 12:50.710
<b>Worked like a charm.</b>

12:51.170 --> 12:53.950
<b>Damn you. What did you do to me?</b>

12:55.970 --> 12:58.570
<b>I just used the Replacement ability.</b>

12:59.080 --> 13:01.590
<b>Your Magic Blade, if you don't mind.</b>

13:03.550 --> 13:04.930
<b>Jeez...</b>

13:03.550 --> 13:04.930
<b>Oh.</b>

13:03.550 --> 13:04.930
<b>Um...</b>

13:11.060 --> 13:14.470
<b>Totally pointless. 
I've already seen that attack.</b>

13:14.910 --> 13:16.310
<b>You're wide open!</b>

13:19.680 --> 13:22.080
<b>There's no way you can beat me.</b>

13:22.720 --> 13:24.910
<b>You've never fought me before.</b>

13:26.540 --> 13:28.900
<b>Well, you <i>are</i> annoyingly fast.</b>

13:29.160 --> 13:32.250
<b>And you have such sexy thighs.
 That's 120 points.</b>

13:32.520 --> 13:34.090
<b>That's embarrassing! Cut it out!</b>

13:34.830 --> 13:39.580
<b>You said it was pointless using Compound 
Upgrade because you've seen it, right?</b>

13:39.580 --> 13:42.590
<b>Yeah. I can dodge attacks I know.</b>

13:42.590 --> 13:45.660
<b>You're forgetting something 
important, though.</b>

13:46.040 --> 13:52.340
<b>Even if it's the same ability, the power's 
totally different between a Seven and Six Star.</b>

13:52.540 --> 13:53.340
<b>Huh?</b>

13:52.540 --> 13:53.340
<b>Ah.</b>

13:52.540 --> 13:53.340
<b>Hm?</b>

13:53.610 --> 13:55.380
<b>Invisible Magic Blade!</b>

14:03.140 --> 14:03.950
<b>Dude!</b>

14:03.140 --> 14:03.950
<b>Oh my.</b>

14:04.300 --> 14:09.400
<b>My starting point was that Compound Upgrade
 had the power to combine <i>any</i> spells.</b>

14:09.850 --> 14:14.450
<b>So I tried combining Magic Blast 
and Swordflash, then added in Conceal.</b>

14:14.740 --> 14:19.720
<b>That gave me a Magic Blade more powerful 
than anything anyone had ever seen.</b>

14:20.890 --> 14:23.200
<b>You got me there, punk.</b>

14:24.210 --> 14:26.460
<b>Brilliant as usual, Master.</b>

14:27.860 --> 14:30.230
<b><i>Of course that's a lie.</i></b>

14:30.530 --> 14:33.180
<b><i>The Company modified the effect.</i></b>

14:33.960 --> 14:37.560
<b>Never thought I'd get to pull this one out.</b>

14:38.460 --> 14:40.560
<b>I'm gonna enjoy myself with this one!</b>

14:46.560 --> 14:47.580
<b>What?</b>

14:47.580 --> 14:49.580
<b>Dual Wield!</b>

14:56.140 --> 14:58.450
<b>C'mon, c'mon, c'mon, c'mon!</b>

14:58.740 --> 15:00.210
<b>You losers!</b>

15:00.210 --> 15:03.530
<b>Time to say good night!</b>

15:04.440 --> 15:06.210
<b>I guess this is it.</b>

15:10.240 --> 15:11.760
<b>Asamiya! Enomoto!</b>

15:10.250 --> 15:11.760
<b>Mya-chan!</b>

15:10.470 --> 15:11.760
<b>Enomoto-sama!</b>

15:12.000 --> 15:14.880
<b>Tch. Finally got rid of two.</b>

15:15.540 --> 15:18.150
<b>What a waste of calories, man.</b>

15:18.150 --> 15:22.230
<b>Shinohara, you can't use 
Compound Upgrade anymore.</b>

15:22.230 --> 15:24.640
<b>You got carried away and wasted it.</b>

15:24.870 --> 15:29.100
<b>You've completely run out 
of spells, haven't you?</b>

15:35.440 --> 15:36.370
<b>Akizuki!</b>

15:36.370 --> 15:38.240
<b>Akizuki-sama, what are you doing?</b>

15:38.240 --> 15:39.240
<b>Huh?</b>

15:40.480 --> 15:42.260
<b>Don't be like that, Shirayuki-chan.</b>

15:42.260 --> 15:44.660
<b>You can't have Hiroto-kun all to yourself.</b>

15:50.330 --> 15:54.220
<b>Then I guess you're next! Die!</b>

15:56.690 --> 15:57.930
<b>Akizuki!</b>

15:56.690 --> 15:57.930
<b>Akizuki-sama!</b>

16:03.350 --> 16:04.560
<b>Akizuki!</b>

16:07.670 --> 16:12.670
<b>Hiroto-kun, did I help at least a little?</b>

16:12.670 --> 16:14.140
<b>Of course you did!</b>

16:14.790 --> 16:21.250
<b>Oh, good. I hope I became your number one.</b>

16:22.850 --> 16:24.870
<b>A-Akizuki.</b>

16:29.630 --> 16:33.880
<b>Oh, c'mon now. I had higher 
hopes for Eimei's Little Devil,</b>

16:33.880 --> 16:35.800
<b>but I guess a loser's still a loser—</b>

16:38.270 --> 16:39.590
<b>Wh-What?</b>

16:41.060 --> 16:45.130
<b><i>Action Unavailable! It's the same thing
 Shirayuki-chan got stuck with!</i></b>

16:45.130 --> 16:46.870
<b>Oh, this must be Akizuki's doing!</b>

16:47.080 --> 16:49.100
<b><i>Yeah, Noa-chan did it!</i></b>

16:49.100 --> 16:54.990
<b><i>She set up a powerful revenge ability 
that'd activate when she got eliminated!</i></b>

16:54.990 --> 16:58.610
<b>Tch. C'mon, now. 
I'm sure you're not that stupid,</b>

16:58.610 --> 17:01.130
<b>but did you really think 
this would stop me?</b>

17:01.360 --> 17:02.110
<b>What?</b>

17:07.120 --> 17:09.390
<b>Inability Barrier Upgrade.</b>

17:09.390 --> 17:15.500
<b>It's an invincible wall that automatically 
shuts out any attack I wasn't able to block.</b>

17:17.960 --> 17:20.140
<b>That's your third one, Kirigaya.</b>

17:20.620 --> 17:24.940
<b>Compound Upgrade, Dual Wield, 
and now, Inability Barrier Upgrade.</b>

17:24.940 --> 17:26.650
<b>You've run out of options.</b>

17:26.650 --> 17:28.640
<b>Huh? So what?</b>

17:28.640 --> 17:33.520
<b>As long as this wall is up, 
you can't even scratch me.</b>

17:33.520 --> 17:37.140
<b>But I can attack as much 
as I want from inside it.</b>

17:37.140 --> 17:40.720
<b>Attack from inside it? Right.</b>

17:41.330 --> 17:42.170
<b>Huh?</b>

17:48.120 --> 17:49.110
<b>What?</b>

17:49.940 --> 17:55.640
<b>Essentially, since I am able to cast spells
 remotely, I could indeed attack you.</b>

17:55.640 --> 17:59.880
<b>Damn it. Y-You betrayed me, you asshole.</b>

18:00.860 --> 18:02.330
<b>Nonsense!</b>

18:03.500 --> 18:06.270
<b>Did you forget how I got my nickname?</b>

18:06.270 --> 18:09.340
<b>Not only do I adore Saionji 
Sarasa with all my heart,</b>

18:09.340 --> 18:13.650
<b>but I am the Phoenix who will rise 
to challenge her time and time again.</b>

18:13.870 --> 18:17.170
<b>How could I of all people 
tolerate a filthy fake Empress?</b>

18:17.990 --> 18:19.900
<b>I would <i>never</i> accept that!</b>

18:19.900 --> 18:22.240
<b>You mean you planned this from the start—</b>

18:22.240 --> 18:23.650
<b>Yup, that's it exactly.</b>

18:24.450 --> 18:27.280
<b>It's only for this game...</b>

18:27.640 --> 18:28.700
<b>Hello?</b>

18:29.590 --> 18:31.160
<b><i>Shinohara Hiroto?</i></b>

18:31.160 --> 18:33.000
<b>...but Kugasaki and I teamed up.</b>

18:33.700 --> 18:36.000
<b>Tch. Oh well.</b>

18:36.010 --> 18:37.260
<b>Withdraw</b>

18:36.010 --> 18:37.260
<b></b>United
Army

18:36.010 --> 18:37.260
<b>Signal</b>

18:39.060 --> 18:41.540
<b>I've lost this one.</b>

18:43.810 --> 18:46.020
<b>I guess I could go down peacefully.</b>

18:46.020 --> 18:48.140
<b>But why the hell would I do that?</b>

18:55.630 --> 18:56.630
<b>Himeji!</b>

19:05.480 --> 19:07.610
<b>I am very sorry, Master.</b>

19:08.010 --> 19:11.690
<b>Please forgive me for not being able
 to tend to you until the very end.</b>

19:11.690 --> 19:13.320
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

19:13.320 --> 19:15.020
<b>Why did you go and do that?</b>

19:15.020 --> 19:19.540
<b>This plan only worked because 
you were a part of it, Master.</b>

19:20.830 --> 19:24.050
<b>Also, even if I lose a game...</b>

19:24.640 --> 19:26.310
<b>there are still things...</b>

19:27.390 --> 19:28.510
<b>I can do...</b>

19:31.360 --> 19:32.270
<b>for you.</b>

19:42.980 --> 19:46.420
<b>So you're the only one on your team left.</b>

19:47.050 --> 19:48.120
<b>Yeah.</b>

19:48.120 --> 19:51.910
<b>I just hope Saionji can hold out 
until Kururugi gets there to help her.</b>

19:51.910 --> 19:57.250
<b>Hm, I see. So your ace 
is the Demon Maiden.</b>

19:58.270 --> 20:01.170
<b>Kirigaya figured Seijo's 
indiscretion would be exposed,</b>

20:01.170 --> 20:04.410
<b>so he withdrew from the 
United Army at the last second.</b>

20:04.410 --> 20:08.810
<b>If he hadn't withdrawn, his complicity 
may have earned him a disqualification.</b>

20:08.810 --> 20:10.440
<b>Yeah, he sure is a sneaky one.</b>

20:10.440 --> 20:14.740
<b>Since my betrayal has been exposed, 
I've also withdrawn from the United Army.</b>

20:14.740 --> 20:18.440
<b>Maybe I'll follow Kirigaya's lead
 and secure my own rank.</b>

20:19.640 --> 20:22.950
<b>It's a little frustrating since 
it feels like you read me my eulogy,</b>

20:22.950 --> 20:24.960
<b>but I'll be seeing you, rival.</b>

20:25.340 --> 20:29.380
<b>Now you must protect the 
Empress's honor in my place.</b>

20:33.670 --> 20:37.270
<b><i>I just hope Kururugi can 
defeat Miss Hundred Faces.</i></b>

20:48.100 --> 20:49.880
<b>Guess I'll finish you off.</b>

20:52.510 --> 20:53.390
<b>Now!</b>

20:54.150 --> 20:55.160
<b>This is...</b>

20:55.980 --> 20:57.810
<b>the end for you!</b>

20:57.810 --> 20:59.270
<b>One-Shot Kill!</b>

21:02.660 --> 21:03.950
<b>Did you get her?</b>

21:06.920 --> 21:08.400
<b>You did!</b>

21:11.780 --> 21:12.750
<b>Huh?</b>

21:12.750 --> 21:14.530
<b>I-I'm sorry.</b>

21:17.360 --> 21:20.250
<b>What a cheap trick, betraying me like that.</b>

21:20.490 --> 21:22.760
<b>This... This can't be.</b>

21:23.260 --> 21:26.550
<b>We all did everything we could
to create that opening...</b>

21:26.550 --> 21:28.750
<b>Well, I guess I expected as much.</b>

21:28.750 --> 21:32.270
<b>If One-Shot Kill doesn't 
kill you, what's left?</b>

21:33.050 --> 21:36.340
<b>This means we finally have a winner.</b>

21:44.290 --> 21:45.890
<b>Oh, what a shame.</b>

21:46.180 --> 21:51.230
<b>I'll let you hang on to the title
of "Empress" until the final day.</b>

21:58.480 --> 22:01.020
<b>How did I survive?</b>

22:03.010 --> 22:04.470
<b>Fourth Day: Finished</b>

22:04.470 --> 22:06.010
<b>Team with the most held areas:
 District 12, Seijo Academy</b>

22:04.470 --> 22:06.010
<b>spaces</b>

22:06.010 --> 22:07.470
<b>Team with the most supporting votes:
 District 12, Seijo Academy</b>

22:07.470 --> 22:10.010
<b>Survivors: 3</b>
